WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.572 --> 00:00:05.514
IT’S AN INVENTION OF THE LEFT.

00:00:05.516 --> 00:00:07.495
&gt;&gt; Laura: THANKS, MATT.

00:00:07.496 --> 00:00:10.343
I WANT TO GO TO TO AFTERMATH OF

00:00:10.344 --> 00:00:11.544
THE CHAUVIN TRIAL.

00:00:11.579 --> 00:00:12.977
AN ALTERNATE SPEAKING OUT ABOUT

00:00:13.012 --> 00:00:16.194
THE SENSE OF FEAR THAT SHE AND

00:00:16.195 --> 00:00:18.429
HER COLLEAGUES FELT.

00:00:18.464 --> 00:00:20.144
HERE’S WHAT LISA CHRISTENSEN

00:00:20.179 --> 00:00:21.442
TOLD CNN YESTERDAY.

00:00:21.476 --> 00:00:23.997
&gt;&gt; I WAS CONCERNED TO MY SAFETY

00:00:23.998 --> 00:00:26.426
TO A POINT THAT WE HADN’T HEARD

00:00:26.427 --> 00:00:28.449
ANY FACTS OR ANYTHING YESTERDAY.

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:30.627
SO DEPENDING WHICH WAY IT WENT,

00:00:30.629 --> 00:00:32.867
I FELT LIKE SOME PEOPLE -- YOU

00:00:32.868 --> 00:00:33.894
CAN’T PLEASE EVERYBODY ALL THE

00:00:33.929 --> 00:00:34.263
TIME.

00:00:34.297 --> 00:00:37.303
I FELT CERTAIN GROUPS MIGHT FEEL

00:00:37.304 --> 00:00:39.072
CERTAIN WAYS.
I WAS CONCERNED ABOUT THAT.

00:00:39.073 --> 00:00:58.124
I WAS CONCERNED ABOUT THAT.
&gt;&gt; Laura: SHE WAS MORE

00:00:58.126 --> 00:01:02.729
&gt;&gt; Laura: SHE WAS MOREWITH A

00:01:02.731 --> 00:01:05.094
&gt;&gt; Laura: SHE WAS MOREWITH A

00:01:05.096 --> 00:01:06.671
LOCAL REPORTER.

00:01:06.672 --> 00:01:10.772
ALAN, IT’S HARD TO IMAGINE THAT

00:01:10.807 --> 00:01:13.374
SENSE OF FEAR DIDN’T IMPACT THE

00:01:13.375 --> 00:01:15.128
JURY IN SOME WAY.

00:01:15.129 --> 00:01:18.262
BUT WE WON’T KNOW, I GUESS.

00:01:18.264 --> 00:01:19.251
WE’LL NEVER KNOW.

00:01:19.285 --> 00:01:20.266
YOUR THOUGHTS?

00:01:20.267 --> 00:01:21.437
&gt;&gt; WE SHOULD NO.

00:01:21.439 --> 00:01:24.059
THERE’S NOT A REASON THE JUDGE

00:01:24.061 --> 00:01:25.841
SHOULD HAVE CALLED IN EVERY

00:01:25.842 --> 00:01:27.239
SINGLE JURY AFTER CONGRESSWOMAN

00:01:27.274 --> 00:01:28.778
WATERS MADE HER STATEMENTS.

00:01:28.812 --> 00:01:30.420
WHY NOT CALL IN THE JURORS AND

00:01:30.421 --> 00:01:31.545
ASK THEM, DO YOU KNOW ABOUT THIS

00:01:31.546 --> 00:01:32.297
STATEMENT?

00:01:32.332 --> 00:01:34.707
HAVE YOU HEARD ABOUT IT?

00:01:34.741 --> 00:01:35.518
ARE YOU AFRAID?

00:01:35.552 --> 00:01:37.728
DO YOU HAVE THE KIND OF FEAR

00:01:37.762 --> 00:01:39.599
THAT IF YOU COME OUT WITH A

00:01:39.634 --> 00:01:41.624
VERDICT THAT WILL NOT PLEASE

00:01:41.658 --> 00:01:44.534
SOMEONE IT COULD CAUSE RIOTS?

00:01:44.536 --> 00:01:47.290
I HAVE ABSOLUTELY ZERO DOUBT

00:01:47.291 --> 00:01:49.516
THAT JURORS IN THAT JURY ROOM

00:01:49.518 --> 00:01:51.063
WERE WORRIED ABOUT THEIR WELFARE

00:01:51.064 --> 00:01:53.204
IF THEY WERE TO COME TO A

00:01:53.239 --> 00:01:54.274
CONCLUSION THAT MURDER WAS NOT

00:01:54.276 --> 00:01:54.836
COMMITTED?

00:01:54.838 --> 00:01:57.846
IF THEY HAD COME TO A VERDICT OF

00:01:57.847 --> 00:02:00.363
MANSLAUGHTER OR NOT GUILTY, THEY

00:02:00.398 --> 00:02:02.289
WOULD WORRY THEIR WELFARE, THEIR

00:02:02.290 --> 00:02:03.424
CHILDREN, THEIR BUSINESSES,

00:02:03.425 --> 00:02:04.412
THEIR SCHOOLS, THEIR

00:02:04.446 --> 00:02:05.283
NEIGHBORHOODS WOULD BE BURNED

00:02:05.285 --> 00:02:05.728
DOWN.

00:02:05.763 --> 00:02:08.019
THEY WEREN’T THE ONLY ONES THAT

00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:09.076
WERE WORRIED.

00:02:09.078 --> 00:02:10.480
EVERY POLICE CHIEF, THE MAYOR.

00:02:10.514 --> 00:02:12.405
THE PRESIDENT OF THE UNITED

00:02:12.439 --> 00:02:13.787
STATES SAID THE JURORS WERE

00:02:13.821 --> 00:02:14.695
UNDER ENORMOUS PRESSURE.

00:02:14.696 --> 00:02:17.418
THAT’S NOT THE WAY IT’S SUPPOSED

00:02:17.453 --> 00:02:18.409
TO OPERATE.

00:02:18.411 --> 00:02:21.846
JURORS ARE SUPPOSED TO BE

00:02:21.847 --> 00:02:23.479
ISOLATED, INSULATED, SEGREGATED

00:02:23.481 --> 00:02:26.106
AND KEPT IN A SEPARATE HOTEL

00:02:26.140 --> 00:02:28.358
ROOM DURING THE ENTIRE PROCESS

00:02:28.392 --> 00:02:29.771
AND NEVER SHOULD HAVE BEEN

00:02:29.805 --> 00:02:31.908
ALLOWED TO HEAR WHAT PEOPLE LIKE

00:02:31.909 --> 00:02:34.338
MAXINE WATERS WERE THREATENING.

00:02:34.372 --> 00:02:36.052
&gt;&gt; Laura: ALAN, REALLY QUICK

00:02:36.087 --> 00:02:36.807
QUESTION.

00:02:36.841 --> 00:02:40.033
ARE YOU CONCERNED ABOUT A

00:02:40.034 --> 00:02:42.966
PRECEDENT BEING SET WITH THIS

00:02:42.967 --> 00:02:47.302
TRIAL WITH FUTURE TRIALS OF

00:02:47.303 --> 00:02:49.417
PEOPLE, POLICE OFFICERS, OTHERS

00:02:49.418 --> 00:02:51.409
WHOSE OUTCOME -- DOESN’T THIS

00:02:51.411 --> 00:02:53.225
SET ITS OWN PRECEDENT?

00:02:53.259 --> 00:02:55.622
&gt;&gt; WE ALREADY SEE THAT WITH KIM

00:02:55.656 --> 00:02:57.053
POTTER THAT COMMITTED NO CRIME

00:02:57.054 --> 00:02:58.568
WHATSOEVER HAVING BEEN CHARGED

00:02:58.569 --> 00:02:59.615
WITH MANSLAUGHTER.

00:02:59.617 --> 00:03:01.700
WE SEE IT WITH THE OTHER THREE

00:03:01.702 --> 00:03:02.330
ACCESSORIES.

00:03:02.331 --> 00:03:05.248
WE DON’T KNOW WHETHER THEY WILL

00:03:05.249 --> 00:03:06.781
GET A SEQUESTERED JURY.

00:03:06.815 --> 00:03:08.235
THE TRIAL WILL TAKE PLACE IN

00:03:08.236 --> 00:03:08.642
MINNEAPOLIS.

00:03:08.644 --> 00:03:09.985
THAT IS A MISTAKE.

00:03:09.986 --> 00:03:12.494
IT’S GOING TO BE VERY HARD FOR

00:03:12.529 --> 00:03:15.277
THE JUDGE IN THAT CASE TO MAKE A

00:03:15.278 --> 00:03:16.513
DECISION WHETHER TO SEQUESTER.

00:03:16.548 --> 00:03:19.150
IF THE JUDGE SEQUESTERS, IT WILL

00:03:19.151 --> 00:03:21.447
BE A SLAP IN THE FACE.

00:03:21.481 --> 00:03:23.913
IF THE JUDGE DOESN’T SEQUESTER,

00:03:23.915 --> 00:03:25.792
HE OUGHT TO LEARN HIS LESSON.

00:03:25.793 --> 00:03:27.504
&gt;&gt; Laura: THE CONSTITUTION I

00:03:27.538 --> 00:03:28.843
DON’T THINK WE WANT TERRIFIED

00:03:28.844 --> 00:03:29.155
JURORS.

00:03:29.189 --> 00:03:29.703
OKAY?

00:03:29.704 --> 00:03:32.205
TERRIFIED JURORS ARE GOING TO BE

00:03:32.206 --> 00:03:34.055
UNDER ENORMOUS PRESSURE TO COME

00:03:34.056 --> 00:03:34.883
DOWN ONE WAY OR THE OTHER AND

